        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luis Gianneo, Ariel Ramírez, Juan Carlos Zorzi, Virtú Maragno, Pedro Ignacio Calderón, Rodolfo Arizaga\n- Roles: music educator, composer, pianist, music director\n\nFacts:\n- Luis Gianneo, as a music educator, taught composers Ariel Ramírez, Juan Carlos Zorzi, Virtú Maragno, Pedro Ignacio Calderón, and Rodolfo Arizaga, among others.\n- Ariel Ramírez was born on 4 September 1921 and died on 18 February 2010.\n- Ariel Ramírez was an Argentine composer, pianist, and music director.",
